c.a             --stack_size=4096             --heap_size=1024         " sysConfigBuildOptions="             --output .             --product ${COM_TI_MSPM0_SDK_INSTALL_DIR}/.metadata/product.json             --compiler ticlang         " sourceLookupPath="${COM_TI_MSPM0_SDK_INSTALL_DIR}/source/ti/driverlib" description="Layered NUEDC2025 MSPM0 project for direct CCS import">
